  "notes": "Gilsey Avenue jogs at Glenway: north leg at x~3230, south leg (labelled GILSEY further south, 'AVE.' near Glenway) at x~3104, slanting to x~3140 at St. Lawrence; south of St. Lawrence the same street is printed SUIRE AVE (name change, both names recorded at that crossing). Iliff Avenue also jogs at Glenway: north leg x~3667, south leg x~3520. Rosemont Avenue is narrow (25-30 ft) north of Glenway and 60 ft south of it; its lot lines shift slightly east southward (centre ~2465 at Glenway to ~2520 at W. Eighth). Printed names: 'W. LIBERTY' (no suffix seen; recorded as West Liberty Street), 'ST. LAWRENCE' (no suffix seen; recorded as St. Lawrence Avenue), 'W. EIGHTH' (West 8th Street), 'ST. WILLIAM AVE.', 'JAMESTOWN ST.', '..LAND AVE.' (Midland), 'SIKER', 'ROSEMONT', 'DEWEY', 'GILSEY', 'ILIFF', 'WINFIELD', 'WEBER LANE', 'VINCENT', 'REGINA', 'HARRIS', 'SUIRE'. West 8th Street runs along the plate's bottom edge, centre taken at ~5860 (south edge near the plate edge). St. Lawrence centre taken between the lot lines (~4165-4225). A 'DRIVEWAY' inside the Chase lots (~2700,3120) is private and not picked. Street at x~4110 crossing W. Liberty and Glenway lies outside the 1780-4020 range."
